{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>The owner of the pit.</b> The one who opens it or digs it, even though it is in the public domain, for he made it for his own need; therefore he is called the owner of the pit." "<b>He shall return silver to its owner.</b> That he shall pay the value of the one who fell while he was alive, after deducting from it the value of the dead one."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:12.947069014Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}